Section 8 of the Supreme Court Act, in this Order referred to as the Act, is

(a) by repealing subsection (2) and by substituting the following new subsection therefor - "(2) His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan may remove a Judge from office on the ground of his inability to properly perform the function of his office or of his misbehaviour.";

(b) by repealing subsection (3);

(c) by repealing subsection (4). Made this 28th. day of Jamadilakhir, 1441 Hijriah corresponding to the 22nd. day of February, 2020 at Our Istana Nurul Iman, Bandar Seri Begawan, Brunei Darussalam.

YANG DI-PERTUAN, BRUNEI DARUSSALAM. Dicetak oleh Jabatan Percetakan Kerajaan, Bandar Seri Begawan BB3510, Negara Brunei Darussalam.
